; Registros de techinrio.com.br para GitHub Pages.
; Importar em Cloudflare: DNS > Records > Import and Export.
; Import é aditivo: apague antes os registros antigos da Vercel (ver MIGRACAO.md).
; DNS only (cf-proxied:false) até o HTTPS do GitHub Pages estar ativo.
$ORIGIN techinrio.com.br.
$TTL 300
@    IN A     185.199.108.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
@    IN A     185.199.109.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
@    IN A     185.199.110.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
@    IN A     185.199.111.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
@    IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8000::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
@    IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8001::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
@    IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8002::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
@    IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8003::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
www  IN CNAME techinrio.github.io. ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
